IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User elprobes@gmail.com
PassCmd "cat ~/.config/secrets/gmail.pass"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/gmail/INBOX

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns * ![Gmail]/All Mail ![Gmail]/Important ![Gmail]/Starred
Create Near
Expunge Both
SyncState *
